@startuml Checkout
title Checkout, happy path

actor Customer
participant "Web app" as Web
participant "Order service" as Orders
database "Ledger" as Ledger

Customer -> Web : Place order
activate Web

Web -> Orders : POST /orders
activate Orders

Orders -> Ledger : reserve funds
activate Ledger
Ledger --> Orders : reservation id
deactivate Ledger

Orders --> Web : 201 Created
deactivate Orders

Web --> Customer : Confirmation
deactivate Web

note over Orders, Ledger
  The reservation is released
  automatically after 15 minutes.
end note

@enduml
